-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1116, a guard. skip-alone.l4 importing a file that DEFINES
-- `taken now` and has an #EVAL of it. The skip trace here passes the buy over
-- (one COMMIT, WITHIN 9), with the clock free and pinned, as it does without
-- the import. It must go on doing so.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `own-eval-self-b`

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Bob
DECLARE Mode IS ONE OF peek, skip
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF
    go HAS mode IS A Mode
    buy

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`shop` MEANS
    PARTY Bob
    MAY buy PROVIDED NOT `taken now`
    WITHIN 10
    HENCE COMMIT `taken` IS TRUE HENCE `shop`
    LEST FULFILLED

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`start` MEANS
    PARTY Bob
    MAY go m
    WITHIN 10
    HENCE COMMIT `taken` IS (IF m EQUALS peek THEN NOT `taken now` ELSE TRUE) HENCE `shop`
    LEST FULFILLED

#TRACE `start` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Bob DOES go skip AT 1
    PARTY Bob DOES buy AT 2
